### File requests
# REST Client file for file endpoints.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@apiKey = my-api-key

### Files - Get file by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Files - Update file by id
PUT {{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "updated-file-name",
  "description": "Updated file metadata"
}

### Files - Delete file by id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Files - List all files
GET {{baseUrl}}/files
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
